<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual receipts 110,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts sold mostly steady with the mid-session Monday. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    48.00 -49.50	   49.00 -50.50</p>
<p>liberal volume	 48.00 -49.00	   49.00 -50.00</p>
<p>few			47.50 &amp;50.00	   48.50</p>
<p>Sows - uneven, generally steady. Top $52.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -44.00	   42.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -46.00	   45.00 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    48.00 -51.50	   49.00 -52.50</p>
